---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: emst.variants
  size: 1
  alias: v
permalink: "{{ v.pathwaysUrl }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Where it can lead: {{ v.role.title }} ({{ v.actorLabel }})"
---
{% import "macros.njk" as m %}
<h1>Where {{ v.role.title }} <span class="emst-muted">({{ v.actorLabel }})</span> can lead</h1>
<nav aria-label="Views for this role variant"><p><a href="{{ v.url | url }}">How it is changing</a> · <a href="{{ v.gapUrl | url }}">Gap check</a> · <strong>Where it can lead</strong></p></nav>
<div class="emst-callout emst-callout--warn" role="note">
  <p><strong>Exploratory, never a recommendation.</strong> Destinations are computed from draft role profiles: roles named as next steps in this role's profile, roles with a drafted learning pathway, and other roles that share at least half of their target competencies with this one. Not yet observed in real career moves.</p>
</div>
{% if v.emergingNext.length %}<p>Also named as next steps in this role's profile, and shown only in <a href="{{ '/whats-coming/' | url }}">What's coming</a> because they are still forming: {% for r in v.emergingNext %}<a href="{{ r.url | url }}">{{ r.title }}</a> ({{ r.lifecycleState }}){% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>{% endif %}
{% if v.pathways.length %}
{% for e in v.pathways %}
<section class="emst-card" aria-labelledby="dest-{{ loop.index }}">
  <h2 id="dest-{{ loop.index }}"><a href="{{ e.toRole.url | url }}">{{ e.toRole.title }}</a></h2>
  <p>{% if e.named %}Named as a next step in this role's profile. {% endif %}{% if e.learning.length %}Exploratory learning pathway drafted ({% for l in e.learning %}{{ l.type }}, {{ l.steps }} steps{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}). {% endif %}Basis: computed from draft role profiles, not observed in career moves.</p>
  <figure class="emst-figure" data-figure data-use-tier="exploratory" data-evidence="{{ e.toRole.evidence.label }}">
    <figcaption>{{ e | sharedText }}</figcaption>
    {% if e.gapCount %}<p>To build ({{ e.gapCount }}{% if e.gapCount > e.gaps.length %}, first {{ e.gaps.length }} shown{% endif %}): {% for g in e.gaps %}<a href="{{ g.competency.url | url }}">{{ g.competency.title }}</a> to {{ g.level }}{% if g.partial %} (raise from this role's target){% endif %}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>{% else %}<p>No competency gap at the destination's target levels.</p>{% endif %}
    <p class="emst-meta"><span class="emst-badge emst-badge--tier" data-badge="tier"><span class="emst-badge__k">Use tier:</span>exploratory</span> {{ m.evBadge(e.toRole.evidence) }}</p>
  </figure>
  <h3>Where this role exists</h3>
  <ul class="usa-list">
  {% for x in e.variants %}
    <li><a href="{{ x.v.url | url }}">{{ x.v.actorLabel }}</a>{% if x.sameActor %} (same sector){% else %} (cross-sector move){% endif %}:
      {% if x.frictions.length %}frictions: {% for f in x.frictions %}{{ f.type }} ({{ f.severity }}, {{ f.direction }}, as of {{ f.asOf }}){% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% else %}no friction records in this build (that does not mean there are none){% endif %}{% if x.crosswalks.length %}; draft crosswalks: {% for c in x.crosswalks | take(4) %}<code>{{ c.object }}</code> ({{ c.predicate | replace("skos:", "") }}, {{ c.date }}){% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}.
      <a href="{{ x.v.gapUrl | url }}">Check gaps</a></li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<div class="emst-callout emst-callout--empty" role="status"><p>No destination meets the display rule for this variant in this build.</p></div>
{% endif %}
